Q("Sales rung with no shift open:", ["Post normally attributed", "Attach to nothing — repaired only by the back-office orphaned-transactions tool", "Are blocked", "Auto-open a shift"], 1, "A correction, not a workflow.", "Ch2"),
Q("Scanning a barcode:", ["Needs the search box focused", "Adds the item straight to the cart — the search box does not need focus", "Opens a dialog", "Needs Enter"], 1, "Scanning is uninterruptible by design.", "Ch3"),
